  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pitcairn Financial  Aid 17/18</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the provision of public services to meet the reasonable assistance needs of the people of Pitcairn (including health, education and securing sea access), given self-sufficiency is currently not a viable option for this UK Overseas Territory. This is in line with the 2012 Overseas Territories White Paper and consistent with relevant elements of UK&#x2019;s Aid Strategy and DFID&#x2019;s 2015-2020 Single Departmental Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
